        {
          "lang": "en",
          "subject": "Measuring equipment deployed",
          "details": "<p>Measuring equipment has been deployed on the seabed in the mentioned position.</p>\n<ul class=\"positions\">\n<li>55&deg; 38.16<strong>6</strong>'N - 012&deg; 41.3<strong>16</strong>'E.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The measuring equipment extends approx. 0.6m above the seabed.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The measuring equipment is not buoyed.&nbsp;</p>"
